================================================================================
Third-Party Components
================================================================================

The package ships source, with no build step and no bundled dependency code.
Its runtime dependencies are installed separately by the package manager and
each is distributed under its own license. Several React parts are derived from
shadcn/ui source (MIT) and carry Ambiq modifications.

THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md lists the runtime dependency tree with license
identifiers and texts, is regenerated by scripts/third-party-notices.mjs in the
repository root, and ships with the package.

Peer dependencies are supplied by the consuming site and are listed in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md by license name only.
